Files in this folder are based on sqlitedataset-0.1.0 and sqlite-3.54.1.

Original source archives are available from <http://sqlitedataset.sourceforge.net/> and <http://sqlite.org/>

src/sqlite3.c is SQLite 3.54.1's amalgamation (SHA3-256
e2b869d3003b33c942b7dd7063604fbc53553e1b66609570df39b9b7b558ee81, as
sqlite.org's release log gives it) with one OXT-Beyond change, each part
marked "OXT-Beyond": when a connection's SQLITE_DBCONFIG_FP_DIGITS is 15,
which src/sqlitedataset.cpp sets on every connection, quote() and the JSON
functions write a real as SQLite 3.51 and earlier did (15 significant
digits; quote() uses the exponent form when 15 do not give the value back)
instead of with 17. Its tests are tests/lcs/core/database/sqlite_values.
include/sqlite3.h and include/sqlite3ext.h are the release's, unchanged.
